There is a staff member at the counter.
I speak to him.
"Hello, I need to get to Fort Kochi," I say.
"I need a new card."
"Can the same card be used for the metro and the water metro?"
He says, "Yes, you can use it."
"Please give me your ID card."
I show him my ID card.
My details are on it.
He looks at the card.
He says, "The new card is two hundred rupees."
I give him two hundred rupees.
He gives me a new card.
"Thank you," I say.
"Where should I board the train?"
He says, "Go up there and board the train."
I take the new card.
I walk to the gate.
